      "text": "Join the fight.",
      "sha256": "1e97d243b9392732476e9718c257e36fae4649a307d1707bcdb7cee0484495bf"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "3dc439a81b83aac42baa1750",
      "document_id": "tx20-oliver-issues",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "17",
      "locator": "paragraph 17",
      "text": "Our Vision for Texas",
      "sha256": "9cc71368431a8588bf26356651edab07b249682126e9172b1a26da2d05e4ad9c"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "022458ed539e6a1834b7ddf5",
      "document_id": "tx20-oliver-issues",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "18",
      "locator": "paragraph 18",
      "text": "To tackle the challenges before us -- millions of us unable to see a doctor, an economy rigged to favor those at the top, and climate change driving a global crisis -- we need big, transformational change.",
      "sha256": "f964a122249b7ac4cb3458e883398355751f9d94637fef85dd44224cbbc16133"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "6576d2719aa9ad15e918361e",
      "document_id": "tx20-oliver-issues",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "19",
      "locator": "paragraph 19",
      "text": "This is a campaign of, by, and for the people of District 25. It is a campaign for Medicare for All, a Green New Deal, a pathway to citizenship for the undocumented, an end to mass incarceration, and for a more just and equitable economy.",
      "sha256": "ce46b1cc2b3cf2ae56c216fa54a36ef99d0ac6f13cda799fd0436947635739a8"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "b1beddd933edc2a4b6d6ce01",
      "document_id": "tx20-oliver-issues",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "20",
      "locator": "paragraph 20",
      "text": "Julie's running a 100% PAC-free campaign. She doesn't take a single dime from any PAC. This is a campaign for the people of Texas -- the thousands of Texans from Wimberley to east Austin to Burleson and everywhere in between -- that Julie has met with and listened to while traveling hundreds of miles across this district to hear their stories and fight with them for real change.",
      "sha256": "34b80ec45199981db1a86d7101ad9d04d8ac04210bd801eb0468de86d4961eba"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "3c94d326b7fd95cb60dbcb65",
      "document_id": "tx20-oliver-issues",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "21",
      "locator": "paragraph 21",
      "text": "Medicare for All",
      "sha256": "550cf77deab73412e89a29397fd27a88bc5ddba9ded216c1cba8fd52f0b44b19"
